                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.711/108: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé at Tangier</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Childs</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-09-24T23:00:00-04:00">September 24,
                            1942—11 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>173. Your despatch 1005, August 27. Department approves the action suggested in
                    your penultimate paragraph.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
